{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And all the elders of</b> — Three times in the Masorah: וכל זקני פרעה, ויבא אהרן וכל זקני ישראל לאכל לחם, וכל זקני העיר ההיא — in the passage of the broken-necked heifer. This is what they expounded: 'Did not feed him' — they did not send him off without provisions, that being וכל זקני ישראל לאכול וגו׳; 'did not escort him' — they did not send him off without escort, that being וכל זקני פרעה, who escorted the coffin of Jacob."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:52.603101259Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}